[G]Where did you come from, [C]where did you [G]go?
[G]Where did you come from, [D]Cotton-Eye [G]Joe?
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Mama's at the window, [C]Mama's at the [G]door
[G]She can't see nothin' but the [D]Cotton-Eyed [G]Joe
[G]Daddy held the fiddle, [C]I held the [G]bow
[G]An' we beat the crud out of [D]Cotton-Eyed [G]Joe
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]If it hadn't been for [C]Cotton-Eye [G]Joe
