[G]Where did you come from, [D]Cotton-Eye [G]Joe?
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]Made himself a a fiddle, [C]made himself a [G]bow
[G]Made a little tune called [D]Cotton-Eyed [G]Joe
[G]Hadn't oughta been for [C]Cotton-Eyed [G]Joe
[G]I'd a-been married a [D]long time [G]ago
{end_of_verse}

