{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[G]Whenever there's a dance all the [C]women want to [G]go
[G]And they all want to dance with the [D]Cotton-Eyed [G]Joe
[G]Daddy won't say but I [C]think he [G]knows
[G]Whatever happened to [D]Cotton-Eyed [G]Joe
{end_of_verse}

