{start_of_verse: Verse 6}
[G]He brought disaster [C]wherever he [G]went
[G]The hearts of the girls was to [C]Hell, broken, [G]sent
[G]They all ran away so [C]nobody would [G]know
[G]And left only men 'cause of [C]Cotton-Eye [G]Joe
{end_of_verse}

